choice May I ask you about the crown? [self.id=rm_ottilie_harrowgate world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called|reckoning|signals|howls|letters|lights|harvest|bell|moot] -> nh_ot
choice About the wake: how should we pay for it? [self.id=rm_oda_harrowgate world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called] -> nh_od_pay
choice About the writ: will you fight it? [self.id=rm_oda_harrowgate world.mem.nh_stage=bell world.mem.nh_writ=read] -> nh_od_choice
choice What do you want, sir? [self.id=rm_ambrose_greatly world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning|signals|howls|letters|lights|harvest|bell|moot] -> nh_am
choice About the ledger: where should it go? [self.id=rm_rosalind_greatly world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning] -> nh_ro_what
choice What does the Council make of it? [self.id=rm_gerrit_mudhand world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called|reckoning|signals|howls|letters|lights|harvest|bell|moot] -> nh_ge
choice Can I ask about the Watch? [self.id=rm_bettany_nailley world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning|signals|howls|letters|lights|harvest|bell|moot] -> nh_be
choice Print it. Every board. [self.id=rm_ingrid_ashwell world.mem.nh_stage=signals] -> nh_list_press
choice Who sold your note to the Counting House? [self.id=rm_corra_slagmore world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning] -> nh_cs
choice This list is yours to mend. [self.id=rm_corra_slagmore world.mem.nh_stage=signals] -> nh_list_captain
choice What's the Counting House paying for a list? [self.id=rm_rune_gullwell world.mem.nh_stage=signals] -> nh_list_price
choice About the harness I found... [self.id=cty_ulric_stonevein world.mem.nh_stage=signals|howls|letters|lights|harvest|bell|moot] -> nh_ul
choice Why did you write to the Wardens? [self.id=rm_gorm_plankgate world.mem.nh_stage=letters|lights|harvest|bell|moot world.mem.nh_wardens=coming|question|watching] -> nh_gm
choice Is something the matter with the water? [self.id=tn_cw_tansy_reedmere world.mem.nh_stage=bell] -> nh_ta
choice Can we talk about the ice? [self.id=tn_cw_kell_greyton world.mem.nh_stage=bell] -> nh_ke
choice What happened to your post? [self.id=rmx_desmond_hollis world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning|signals|howls|letters|lights|harvest|bell] -> nh_dh
choice You wept in the Rain Hall. Over the old King's writ. [self.id=rm_oskar_gullworth world.mem.nh_stage=bell] -> nh_os
choice What's this about the mine's note? [self.id=cty_fenwick_plankworth world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning] -> nh_fw_seam
choice About the charter for the Kestrel seam... [self.id=cty_fenwick_plankworth world.mem.nh_stage=howls] -> nh_fw_charter
choice Come and say it in front of them, at the Lamp and Pick. [self.id=cty_fenwick_plankworth world.mem.nh_stage=bell world.mem.nh_ulric=list] -> nh_fw_come
choice Your wagons pay the Grey Captain. [self.id=rm_aldric_grayrock_ world.mem.nh_stage=letters] -> nh_al
choice Your husband's wagons pay the Captain. [self.id=rm_maren_grayrock_ world.mem.nh_stage=letters] -> nh_ma
choice About your father... [self.id=rm_ingrid_grayrock_ world.mem.nh_stage=letters] -> nh_ig_after
choice Your House has a vote at the Moot. [self.id=rm_tobias_grayrock_ world.mem.nh_stage=letters] -> nh_tb
choice This is from Fellhall, for you. [self.id=rm_osric_mossgrave world.mem.nh_stage=letters] -> nh_gu_match
choice Your accounts keeper writes to Timberland. [self.id=rm_isolde_fell_ world.mem.nh_stage=letters] -> nh_gu_shown
choice I burned your letter. Nobody read it. [self.id=rm_gudrun_fell_ world.mem.nh_stage=letters] -> nh_gu_ash
choice Fancy a game for the hills? [self.id=rm_corwin_fell_ world.mem.nh_stage=letters] -> nh_cw
choice Would the salon help the quarry folk's common right? [self.id=rm_celestine_greatly world.mem.nh_stage=letters] -> nh_ce
choice I need the Counting House day book. [self.id=rm_edric_kelpham world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning] -> nh_edric_book
choice Do these sums agree? [self.id=rm_eleanor_saltcot world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning] -> nh_eleanor_sums
choice Let me in to the flat. [self.id=rm_eleanor_saltcot world.mem.nh_stage=bell] -> nh_el_in
choice Who buys the factors' notes? [self.id=rm_jorunn_ropewick world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning] -> nh_jorunn_notes
choice May I see the Crown's customs tally? [self.id=rm_jasper_bilgeford world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning|signals] -> nh_jasper_tally
choice Where does a kitchen servant get two hundred pennies? [self.id=rm_mab_coalridge world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning] -> nh_mab_coin
choice Did you take the wagon's wool? [self.id=cty_ulla_rusthand world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called] -> nh_ulla_wool
choice Why do you blame the logger? [self.id=tn_oh_cairn_oakhaven world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called] -> nh_cairn_why
choice What are you selling under the counter? [self.id=rm_corra_coalcot world.mem.nh_stage=signals] -> nh_cc_list
choice They say you wanted the potter's post. [self.id=tn_oh_ludo_beechshaw world.mem.nh_stage=lights] -> nh_ludo_post
choice What do your boats carry at night? [self.id=cty_sloe_mistwick world.mem.nh_stage=lights] -> nh_sloe_boats
choice I'll run the warning. [self.id=tn_mb_aspen_marshholm world.mem.nh_stage=harvest] -> nh_as_run
choice The Longmead farmer sent a word for you. [self.id=tn_lf_rowan_downridge world.mem.nh_stage=harvest] -> nh_rw_word
choice There's your ten pennies. What did you see? [self.id=rm_hilde_dripby world.mem.nh_stage=bell pair.mem.nh_hilde=paid] -> nh_hd_said
choice You shouldn't be out on the ice. [self.id=tn_cw_gorse_reedmere world.mem.nh_stage=bell] -> nh_gorse_ice
